			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Synchronize Element submodules and normalize format script\n\nUpdate the `Element` submodule to include a diagnostic probe in `Sky` for Webview registration, addressing silent failures where `_resolvers` maps are populated but `resolve` callbacks never fire. The new probe validates internal state (`_resolvers` and `_awaitingRevival`) and emits structured logs to `Mountain` via IPC, enabling precise differentiation between registration failures and resolver isolation issues during extension hot-reloads.\n\nIn `Maintain/Format.sh`, normalize whitespace in the `shfmt` exclusion logic to match project readability standards. Additionally, reformat the `case` statement indentation and remove inconsistent spacing in the `Current` directory resolution to ensure the build tooling adheres to strict formatting conventions.\n\nThese changes enhance the debuggability of the editor's view lifecycle and maintain consistency in the project's maintenance scripts.",
			"SHA": "5c0ff7cff17f4294f0249ff751c57382f7cef01e"
		},
